# Kubernetes & Helm
*.tgz
.helm/
charts/*/charts/
charts/*/requirements.lock
.cache/
**/Chart.lock**
rendered-chart.yaml
**/helm-render-output

# CMP-rendered chart roots: the helm-render-obs ArgoCD sidecar regenerates
# values.yaml/Chart.yaml from config.yaml at sync time, so committed copies
# are dead weight. Ignoring them prevents a local `helm-renderer --generate-values`
# run + `git add -A` from silently re-committing them (the drift gate in
# .github/workflows/helm-quality-checks.yaml would accept regenerated==committed).
# All per-instance chart roots use this config-driven model.
helm/observability-platform/**/**/core/values.yaml
helm/observability-platform/**/**/core/Chart.yaml
helm/remote-clusters/**/**/core/values.yaml
helm/remote-clusters/**/**/core/Chart.yaml
helm/observability-platform/**/values.yaml
helm/observability-platform/**/Chart.yaml
helm/remote-clusters/**/values.yaml
helm/remote-clusters/**/Chart.yaml
helm/customer-dashboards/**/values.yaml
helm/customer-dashboards/**/Chart.yaml

